    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/KooshaPari/Tracera</packageSourceUrl>
    <docs>Multi-view requirements traceability and project management system for AI agents</docs>
    <summary>Requirements traceability + project management — like Jira/Lattice but for AI agents</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Tracera is an agent-native multi-view requirements traceability and project management system. It provides:

- Multi-view traceability (Story → Trace → Audit)
- Coverage matrix analysis
- SQLite (default) or PostgreSQL backend
- REST + MCP API for agents
- Cloudflare Worker edge deployment
- Desktop shell (Electrobun)

Use Tracera to give your AI agents a structured place to file issues, link requirements, and verify coverage.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/KooshaPari/Tracera/releases/tag/v2.2.0</releaseNotes>
    <tags>tracability project-management ai-agents spec-driven governance requirements</tags>
    <license type="expression">MIT</license>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/KooshaPari/Tracera</projectSourceUrl>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="git" version="2.39.0" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>